officialText:
The commissioner may issue an order to the persons responsible for any unlawful use or condition in any premises
directing such person to correct the unlawful use or condition. Each such order shall have the commissioner’s signature affixed thereto;
but the commissioner may authorize any subordinate to affix such signature, including an electronic signature.

